# What this repository does not track.
#
# The path carries the role. `backend/data/` holds what the coach reads, `backend/reports/`
# what the measurements publish, `docs/` what a person reads; everything a run leaves behind
# lives under `backend/var/`, including the Wikichess articles, which FICGS does not allow
# this repository to redistribute. No line here begins with `!`, because an exception means
# the line above ignored something that had to be kept.

# Everything a run writes and no reader opens: the downloaded corpus, the coverage
# database and its HTML report, the Milvus and Mongo volumes. The only ignored directory.
var/
backend/var/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/

# Tool caches
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Secrets. `.env.example` is tracked and is not matched by this line: it is `.env` exactly,
# so keeping the example needs no exception.
.env
.streamlit/secrets.toml

# Node, for a repository that also ships a frontend
node_modules/

# Editors and operating systems
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
